DreamFaker V3.0
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

	DreamFaker is a small utility that allows users to comment files
	and SysOp to nuke them.

	Faker has changed a bit since last version. Actually it's a total
	rewrite. Configfile is nearly the same, except some entries
	have been obsoleted and some have changed..

	If second parameter is specified in command line, faker is started
	in "Info mode", it tells user stuff that used to be in messages.

	Eg. doors:faker %N info

	Check out supplied example config file for more info on faker.

